	skos:note "The natures come in pairs: ChildOf and ParentOf, CanFollow and CanPrecede. The XSD says CanAlsoBe need not hold in both directions and says nothing on whether PeerOf does. CAPEC 3.9 uses ChildOf and never ParentOf, and records no pair from both ends." ;
