	skos:note "CWE holds the same link from its own side. CAPEC 3.9 and CWE 5.0 each name the same 1212 pairs, which tests/test_catalogue.py holds, so the two classes are the two ends of one link and the mapping is related." , "The XSD says that any one of a pattern's weaknesses, not all of them, may be enough for the attack to succeed." ;
