	linkml:permissible_values <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Alter%20Execution%20Logic> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Bypass%20Protection%20Mechanism> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Execute%20Unauthorized%20Commands> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Gain%20Privileges> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Hide%20Activities> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Modify%20Data> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Other> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Read%20Data> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Resource%20Consumption> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/capec/Unreliable%20Execution> .
